From c0860ac3b73bef98c94f89033ae815e1252d61cc Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Mike Kinney <mike.kinney@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 15 Nov 2026 15:31:27 -0800
Subject: [PATCH] fix(docs): show app icons in the user guide

Add a native Zola 0.23 icon component and operation and control icons in the guide. Pin copied assets, operation mappings, and rendered URLs against the app icon tables. Preserve reachable license notices.

Reuses the released site work from 7d62d830, adapted to current upstream and its pinned Zola version.

Fixes #1901
